<h2 id="includes">What This Service Includes</h2>
<p>A regenerative program is only as strong as the record behind it. This service produces the full operational and compliance framework — not a binder that sits on a shelf, but a living set of policies, procedures, and records that reflect how your practice actually runs.</p>

<h3>What You Get</h3>
<div class="dash-list">
